<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners buy 211.99 mln rand S.African bonds Wed.</title>
<headline>Foreigners buy 211.99 mln rand S.African bonds Wed.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners bought a net 211.99 million rand worth of South African bonds on Wednesday after selling a net 48.43  million rand worth on Tuesday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27</p>
</text>
